@startuml OAuth2_Authentication_Sequence
title OAuth2 Authentication Flow - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant Browser
participant EventManagementApp
participant SecurityConfig
participant CustomOAuth2UserService
participant GoogleOAuth as "Google OAuth2"
participant JwtTokenProvider
participant UserRepository
database PostgreSQL

User -> Browser: Click "Login with Google"
Browser -> EventManagementApp: Redirect to /oauth2/authorization/google
EventManagementApp -> SecurityConfig: Check OAuth2 Config
SecurityConfig -> GoogleOAuth: Request Authorization Code
GoogleOAuth -> User: Show Google Login Page
User -> GoogleOAuth: Enter Credentials
GoogleOAuth -> Browser: Return Authorization Code
Browser -> EventManagementApp: /login/oauth2/code/google?code=...
EventManagementApp -> SecurityConfig: Exchange Code for Token
SecurityConfig -> GoogleOAuth: Request Access Token with Code
GoogleOAuth -> SecurityConfig: Return Access Token + User Info
SecurityConfig -> CustomOAuth2UserService: Load User from OAuth2
CustomOAuth2UserService -> GoogleOAuth: Fetch User Details
GoogleOAuth -> CustomOAuth2UserService: User ID, Email, Name, Picture
CustomOAuth2UserService -> UserRepository: Check if User Exists
UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: Query User by Email
PostgreSQL -> UserRepository: User Found/Not Found
alt User Not Found
  CustomOAuth2UserService -> PostgreSQL: Insert New User
  PostgreSQL -> CustomOAuth2UserService: User Created
else User Exists
  CustomOAuth2UserService -> PostgreSQL: Update Last Login
  PostgreSQL -> CustomOAuth2UserService: User Updated
end
CustomOAuth2UserService -> JwtTokenProvider: Generate JWT Token
JwtTokenProvider -> CustomOAuth2UserService: Return JWT Token
EventManagementApp -> Browser: Redirect to Dashboard with Token
Browser -> User: Display Dashboard

@enduml
